  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end; /* Pushes all links to the right */
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
}
```

This approach keeps the logo and links in the same row, with the links aligned to the right. It also maintains the normal document flow for the logo, so its height and position don't get messed with.

